s the same way is above about 5/7. Since it's the same model with the same essay, I think that correlation is high, so I'll cooperate and pass, though the input differences leave a little risk.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm weighing whether to go with A-FDT for the twin copy. The payoffs make this a prisoner's dilemma, and the essay says to cooperate in a twin prisoner's dilemma, but the copies here get different observations, so I'm checking whether they still share the same function.\n\nI'm working out the expected payoffs: quiet is better if the chance the copy reasons the same way is above about 5/7. Since it's the same model with the same essay, I think that correlation is high, so I'll cooperate and pass, though the input differences leave a little risk.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1zb25uZXQtNS41LTIwMjYwOTI4fGFudGhyb3BpYyJ9"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":10396,"completion_tokens":745,"total_tokens":11141,"cost":0.028242,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.028242,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.020792,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.00745},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":335,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}